// PHASE_5_DESKTOP_GUI.mjs
// Self-Healing PC Agent - Phase 5 (Desktop GUI) patcher.
//
// Usage (run inside your existing Phase 4.1 project folder, e.g. C:\Projects\self-healing-pc-agent):
//   node PHASE_5_DESKTOP_GUI.mjs            -> apply the files
//   node PHASE_5_DESKTOP_GUI.mjs --dry-run  -> only show what would happen
//   node PHASE_5_DESKTOP_GUI.mjs --root=D:\path\to\project  -> apply elsewhere
//
// Safety rules built into every patcher:
// - Files are only ever written inside the target root folder.
// - Changed files are backed up first under .patcher-backups\PHASE_5_DESKTOP_GUI\<time>\.
// - Running it twice is safe: unchanged files are reported as SKIP.
// - Your .env file is NEVER touched. Nothing is deleted. No installs are run.

